<title>NEW ZEALAND: Franklin has 10.59 pct of Air NZ.</title>
<headline>Franklin has 10.59 pct of Air NZ.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franklin Resources Inc became a substantial security holder in Air New Zealand &quot;B&quot; shares on March 19, with a relevant interest in 10.59 percent of the voting securities of the company, the New Zealand Stock Exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said a notice to this effect had not yet been signed by Franklin Resources and had been provided to the Stock Exchange by law firm Buddle Findlay.</p>
<p>Earlier, in a separate notice, Franklin said it had taken a 6.47 percent interest in Tranz Rail.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
